{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4f71f4c1771c285a39fc9d39135946475c4714b7bc10c63f801797dd2c56fa44", "ja": "（今日は新衣装のフィッティングだ。\nエレナ、気に入ってくれるといいな……）", "zh": "（今天是新服装的试穿。希望艾蕾娜会喜欢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "e376c1bd1b68202d3f39306b481ff2450165fbba05ed8247ad5a03e24e68a195", "ja": "フンフンフーン、フフフーン♪\nあ、{$P$}、お疲れさまっ！", "zh": "哼哼哼——，呼呼呼——♪\n啊，{$P$}，辛苦啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e3bf3c5f62c2adbce39e8ffd469dba6cbc0cd56e804cb0a7e8ef19320a9d1edc", "ja": "お疲れ様、エレナ。\nその様子だと、新しい衣装は問題なさそうだな。", "zh": "辛苦了，艾蕾娜。\n看你的样子，新服装似乎没什么问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "0abe78360f57c44576cdf2db652b9de1de0b4ecd6aac363f7d3f39438472824d", "ja": "うん、バッチリ♪　ねーねー{$P$}、\nこの衣装、ちょっと大人っぽいよネ……？", "zh": "嗯，特别合身♪ 喂喂，{$P$}，\n这身衣服是不是有点成熟风……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1355926c76c3bab61c30107153c5db5085b2b95dc00a6023d86715cc3ca826f0", "ja": "うん、そうだな。\n大人っぽくて、よく似合ってると思う。", "zh": "嗯，确实是这样。\n很有成熟感，我觉得很适合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1005_018ele", "source_sha256": "26d4fdf07cb38b7b58308c594ff6d5ecaad58b0de4c845b5b47531bf11bfbc4e", "ja": "ホントに？　エヘヘ、うれしいナ……♪", "zh": "真的吗？嘿嘿，好开心呀……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "bd274e8f43827239defd527b275296329aea93946632369226e9832948e4c5aa", "ja": "新しい衣装をもらったから、元気いっぱいだヨー。\n今なら、何時間でもダンスできちゃいそう♪", "zh": "拿到新服装之后，我现在充满精神哦～\n感觉要是现在的话，跳几个小时的舞都不成问题呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1007_p", "source_sha256": "214e42ad33e7fd2f6c2023eb8a89612707eab4d4de9d0a18b13f036a33a9d587", "ja": "はは、そうか。\nとはいえ、あんまり飛ばしすぎないようにな！", "zh": "哈哈，是吗。话虽如此，可别太拼命了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "345233ea9590691b913c290735920187a16381a0851dc9fc432a00c39dd35e48", "ja": "ハーイ！　疲れちゃったときは、\nママンのおいしいご飯を食べるから大丈夫！", "zh": "嗨！累了的时候，\n吃妈妈做的美味饭菜就没问题啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "2572fdf53787d92332b0caa29fef98251500d753760ca91b6a32fd9f4511ccda", "ja": "フェジョアーダでしょ、ムケッカでしょ。あとは\nコシーニャ……どれもすっごく美味しいんだヨ♪", "zh": "有黑豆炖肉，还有巴西海鲜炖菜。然后是\n鸡肉可乐饼……每一道都超级好吃哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1010_p", "source_sha256": "50123c18c8c39027e1d793fc8cce9c74be5fc0b0b8abd1aa8e54025cd83885ca", "ja": "そういえば、この前エレナが作ってくれた\nブラジル料理はどれも美味しかったな。", "zh": "说起来，上次艾蕾娜做的巴西料理，每一道都很好吃啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1011_018ele", "source_sha256": "ebb37ba850c84c3f7a9e243690a635127b3e4ecb637ebf582f5927546bbca779", "ja": "{$P$}も、たくさん食べてたネ！\nみんなも気に入ってくれたみたいで、よかった。", "zh": "{$P$}也吃了很多呢！\n大家好像也都很喜欢，太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "e5c5f1958180cb6c0e079c14b2acbcb62e5d832870c255e8104e3d3d8c354c6b", "ja": "お腹いっぱい食べて、みんなでサンバを踊って。\nちょっとブラジルにいた時のコトを思い出しちゃった。", "zh": "吃得饱饱的，大家一起跳桑巴舞。我不由得想起了在巴西时的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "2b76fafb22be2cbe971c66069c8c6b10c80640f315ecdf5baf64b934887d7956", "ja": "カーニバルの間は、みんなでダンスしたり、パレードを\n見に行ったり、町全体がワクワクでいっぱいなノ！", "zh": "狂欢节期间，大家一起跳舞，还会去看游行，整座城市都充满了期待和兴奋呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1014_p", "source_sha256": "a9023d97b3bdeac58b672619cf0028a570057a90bc3553b9efff90fd33782251", "ja": "エレナの話を聞くだけで楽しそうだな。\n本場のカーニバルか……いつか行ってみたいな。", "zh": "光是听艾蕾娜讲，就觉得一定很有意思。\n正宗的狂欢节啊……真想哪天去看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "94b8675f98aaa81cf312e62c1c6ee00d6264822cf81bb03c47ff2301e34f8fff", "ja": "うん！　{$P$}も一緒に行こうよ！\nワタシ、このドレス着て、パレードに参加するネ♪", "zh": "嗯！{$P$}也一起去吧！\n我穿上这件礼服，参加游行吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "b36c546bcf4302cf21f4f9ff92d4c68c49fc842a2b34313575f9d55fe3e4185e", "ja": "{$P$}の衣装は、ワタシが\n作ってあげるネ！　きっと、ママンが教えてくれるヨ。", "zh": "{$P$}的服装，就由我\n来帮你做吧！妈妈肯定会教我的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ce6fd7892365ca200c225a0993d4743ee9f5d01ca4e4c130ff2708b1644162d1", "ja": "えっ？　俺も参加するのか？", "zh": "诶？我也要参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "6fe9a01ee80cf9099ed97b51e8a245cc978711827e36edf1d3730d695c0c40e4", "ja": "もちろん！　パレードを見てるのも楽しいけど、\nやっぱりサンバは一緒に踊らないとネ♪", "zh": "当然啦！虽然看游行也很开心，但桑巴还是要一起跳才行嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_018ele0374_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_018ele0374_1019_018ele", "source_sha256": "6ae20b82fe5cc0c94b073ad47386f135598b07c23a9832cf32e655f22a941980", "ja": "{$P$}と一緒にカーニバル！\n……すっごく楽しみだヨー。エヘヘ♪", "zh": "要和{$P$}一起狂欢！\n……超级期待的唷。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
